    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d413">

                <pb facs="0454" n="370" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg370"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. No. 614.119/104</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Leavell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-20T10:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 20, 1918, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received September 22, 12.34
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your September 18, 5 p.m. In an interview yesterday afternoon President Cabrera assured me that full authority to sell
                    would be <pb facs="0455" n="371" xml:id="pg371"/> given to the Alien Property
                    Custodian within a few days, and asked me to inform the Department, but not to
                    reveal it otherwise until the decree is published.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Leavell</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
